{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t尼日利亞警方說，東北部包奇州發生襲擊事件，一名中國公民遭武裝人員襲擊死亡。<br/>\n<br/>\n警方說，襲擊發生於本月14日，另有一名當地警察在與襲擊者交火時身亡，安全部門已展開行動，搜捕襲擊者。<br/>\n　<br/>\n近年來，尼日利亞安全形勢持續動蕩，今年10月，西北部凱比州也曾發生襲擊事件，造成一名中國公民遇難。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：方潤南\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T01:03:01.148535+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":145,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T00:45:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T10:37:49.910379+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T00:56:35.792383+00:00","content_hash":"d673e25d7a15c90ca905a1396ab95f8b06547a30cb1a78946cd09d71684e64f0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}